What is a Home Elderly Care Robot?
A home elderly care robot is a specialized intelligent robot designed for seniors, aimed at providing daily life support and services to help them live independently at home for longer periods. These robots are typically equipped with a range of advanced features and technologies to meet various needs of the elderly, including AI-powered voice interaction, health monitoring, mobility assistance, fall detection, medication reminders, and companionship capabilities. They are broadly categorized into Humanoid Robots and Animal-like Robots, serving applications across household settings, nursing homes, and other assisted living environments.
